<title>USA: StaffMark buys Texas info tech service co.</title>
<headline>StaffMark buys Texas info tech service co.</headline>
<dateline>FAYETTEVILLE, Ark. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>StaffMark Inc said Tuesday that it has acquired Expert Business Systems, an information technology staffing and consulting firm headquartered in the Dallas/Fort Worth area.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, which will be accounted for as an asset purchase, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Expert Business had annual revenues of about $5.7 million its past fiscal year.</p>
</text>
